; FILED: (sqrt <negative exact>) does not promote to a complex on the VM.
; native -r : +2i     (exact negative → complex, R7RS)
; vm        : +nan.0  (always the double sqrt)
; The inexact form agrees on both substrates: (sqrt -4.0) is +nan.0.
; RECLASSIFIED: current native -r and VM outputs agree: +2i, then +nan.0.
(display (sqrt -4))
(newline)
(display (sqrt -4.0))
(newline)
